      "text": "𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗔𝗱𝘃𝗶𝘀𝗼𝗿𝘆 \n\nIn view of Sankranti Festival–2026, heavy vehicular movement is expected across Hyderabad City due to large-scale travel towards Andhra Pradesh and Telangana districts. \nPeak traffic: Jan 9–13 \nReturn traffic: Jan 16–19, 2026 \n\nModerate traffic congestion likely at:\n• Kachiguda & Secunderabad Railway Stations\n• MGBS – Aramghar (via Afzalgunj–City College–Puranapool–Bahadurpura)\n• S.R. Nagar – Lakdikapool\n• Rethibowli – Aramghar (via Attapur)\n• Kachiguda – Ramanthapur\n• MGBS – Dilsukhnagar\n\nAdvisory to Commuters:\n• Plan travel in advance\n• Avoid peak hours\n• Use alternate routes\n• Start early for bus/rail journeys\n• Prefer Public Transport & Metro Rail\n Follow traffic signage & cooperate with traffic police\n\n📲 Live Traffic Updates:\n👉 Facebook: Hyderabad Traffic Police\n👉 X (Twitter): @HYDP\n\n📞 Traffic Helpline: 9010203626\nHyderabad Traffic Police request public cooperation for a safe & smooth Sankranti travel.",
